---
---
<!-- SKILLS SECTION -->
<section id="skills" class="reveal-section content-section px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 py-20 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <span class="section-index">03 · Kemampuan</span>
                <h2>Keahlian</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Kemampuan teknis dan dasar perancangan yang saya kuasai.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skills-grid">
            <article class="skill-card">
                <div class="skill-card-top">
                    <div class="skill-icon"><i data-lucide="layout" class="w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <span class="skill-number">01</span>
                </div>
                <h3>UI/UX Design</h3>
                <p>Merancang antarmuka yang intuitif dengan wireframe dan prototipe untuk pengalaman pengguna yang lebih baik.</p>
                <div class="skill-tags" aria-label="Keahlian UI/UX Design">
                    <span>Figma</span>
                    <span>Wireframing</span>
                    <span>Prototyping</span>
                    <span>Design Systems</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="skill-card">
                <div class="skill-card-top">
                    <div class="skill-icon"><i data-lucide="code-2" class="w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <span class="skill-number">02</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Frontend Development</h3>
                <p>Membangun tampilan web responsif dan interaktif, serta menjalankan server portfolio sederhana dengan Node.js.</p>
                <div class="skill-tags" aria-label="Keahlian Frontend Development">
                    <span>HTML5</span>
                    <span>CSS3</span>
                    <span>Tailwind CSS</span>
                    <span>JavaScript</span>
                    <span>Node.js</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="skill-card">
                <div class="skill-card-top">
                    <div class="skill-icon"><i data-lucide="users-round" class="w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                    <span class="skill-number">03</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Soft Skills &amp; Kolaborasi</h3>
                <p>Mengandalkan komunikasi aktif, problem solving, dan manajemen waktu saat bekerja secara mandiri maupun tim.</p>
                <div class="skill-tags" aria-label="Keahlian dan tools pendukung">
                    <span>Problem Solving</span>
                    <span>Git &amp; GitHub</span>
                    <span>Komunikasi Tim</span>
                    <span>Adaptabilitas</span>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
